{"position":335,"sourceId":"ui.romarr-reads-es-de-gamelists-and-mat.deddc5b79b","source":"ROMarr reads ES-DE gamelists and matching local media before online lookup. Publishing writes a shared gamelist and matching covers under the metadata root, using paths relative to the ROM root and matching ES-DE media names. Provider lookups are capped at 200 per scan. Export the portable catalog from","sourceSha256":"deddc5b79b57d630611a75227b419b1718b0f1e0eedb67b2047e344af99c20b1","sourceKind":null,"reportedLocations":["romarr/ui.py:5423"],"productionCallerCount":1,"localizableUiMessageEstablished":true,"callerContextRefs":[{"path":"romarr/ui.py","lineStart":5684,"lineEnd":5688,"contextLines":[{"line":5684,"text":"    +'<button class=\"btn ghost\" id=\"org-undo\" '+(!SETTINGS.metadata_path?'disabled':'')+'>Undo last rename</button>'"},{"line":5685,"text":"    +'<button class=\"btn ghost\" id=\"org-esde\" '+(!SETTINGS.metadata_path?'disabled':'')+'>Publish ES-DE data</button></div>'"},{"line":5686,"text":"    +'<p class=\"help\" style=\"margin:8px 0 0\">ROMarr reads ES-DE gamelists and matching local media before online lookup. Publishing writes a shared gamelist and matching covers under the metadata root, using paths relative to the ROM root and matching ES-DE media names. Provider lookups are capped at 200 per scan. Export the portable catalog from <a href=\"#status\">System → Backup &amp; Export</a>; see the <a href=\"https://github.com/snapetech-org/ROMarrNG/blob/main/docs/features/shared-library-identification.md#portable-metadata\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">format and schema</a>.</p></div>'"},{"line":5687,"text":"    +'<div id=\"org-message\"></div><div id=\"org-status\"></div><div id=\"org-plan-result\"></div>'"},{"line":5688,"text":"    +'<div id=\"org-announcement\" class=\"sr-only\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-atomic=\"true\"></div>'"}],"contextSha256":"18ef336db67ef785dc3bf7706e37273e2421bcc7246ba6c7db2ade3f882f2bed","fileSha256":